### StringBuilder to_text_sep

#### joins parts with separator

- Verify: joins parts with separator
   - Expected: sb.to_text_sep(", ") equals `x, y, z`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 7 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: joins parts with separator")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
val sb = string_builder()
sb.push("x")
sb.push("y")
sb.push("z")
expect(sb.to_text_sep(", ")).to_equal("x, y, z")
```

</details>

